 "text": "Hey! How are you feeling? Nice of them. Do you want keep the box of as is, with a pretty card, or go for something fun like a gift bag? The water is fine, but there' a lot of agricultural runoff, so always wash it. Sure thing. We' wait. Sure, go ahead. Front window typically takes longer because of the hinges. Roughly half an hour each, with a few breaks in between. Then leave those open a bit while cleaning. The front windows with the hinges take bit longer. About half an hour each, with breaks between. They do get used to it. You can also tilt the handle down while cleaning on one of them, which helps a lot.",
